  "description": "Own-ship wind, water and air temperature and pressure from an NMEA 0183 stream as a dynamic feature source: one feature at own ship, true wind as a WMO barb next to the own-ship symbol (from MWD, derived from apparent wind and the vessel's motion, or MWV true), relative wind labelled as such when true wind can't be had, and a pick report with units. Built on EncDotNet.S100.Nmea. Not for navigation.",
